    "minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> i5-3570 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1650/GTX 1050-ti, or AMD RX 470/RX 570, or equivalent performance &amp; VRAM<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 20 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Internet connection required for multiplayer.</li></ul>",
    "recommended": "<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 11 or later (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X﻿ or ﻿i5-12400 ﻿or equivalent performance, 6 physical cores minimum<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2070﻿ or RX 5700, or equivalent performance &amp; VRAM<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 20 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Internet connection required for multiplayer.</li></ul>"
